      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10056557::web::006::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated 316L stainless steel has moderate wear, oxidation, and corrosion resistance.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10056557::web::006::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "FeCoNiCrMo0.2-WC composite layers can be deposited on 316L stainless steel by laser cladding.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10056557::web::006::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "CeO2 can be included as an additive in a laser-clad FeCoNiCrMo0.2-WC coating on 316L stainless steel.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10056557::web::006::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The laser-clad FeCoNiCrMo0.2-WC coating will form a dense, metallurgically bonded layer with uniformly distributed WC particles.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will develop a refined microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will develop protective tribofilms during wear.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA matrix provides solid-solution strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An HEA coating matrix can provide oxidation resistance at temperatures up to about 800 °C.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Embedded WC particles increase hardness and abrasion resistance by hindering dislocation motion and reducing material removal.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Laser cladding the proposed HEA-WC coating will increase the surface hardness of 316L relative to untreated 316L.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10056557::web::006::1_introduction",
        "PMC5849017::web::029::3_2_3_microhardness_and_wear_behavior"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Laser cladding the proposed HEA-WC coating will reduce the wear rate of 316L relative to untreated 316L.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10056557::web::036::5_future_work",
        "PMC5849017::web::029::3_2_3_microhardness_and_wear_behavior"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Laser cladding the proposed HEA-WC coating will improve the corrosion resistance of 316L relative to untreated 316L.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10056557::web::036::5_future_work"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed coating should remain effective in aggressive environments at temperatures up to about 800 °C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
